# --- EmberDepths asset pipeline ---------------------------------------------
# Raw generator output. Regenerate with tools/blender/build_props.py and
# tools/pixellab/fetch_assets.py; only the committed PNGs under
# Assets/_Project/Art are the source of truth for the game.
/tools/_out/
/tools/blender/_render/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.blend1
